# BetterCP/M Help

- [COPY](COPY.HLP) copies files using source-first syntax.
- [PIP](PIP.HLP) transfers files and device streams.
- [DIR](DIR.HLP) lists files by drive and user area.
- [PATH](PATH.HLP) displays and edits the search path.
- [NOAH](NOAH.HLP) manages archives and builds custom help libraries.
- [HELP](HELP.HLP) explains navigation, source selection and reporting.
